# AC-3 — Processing pipeline

Covered by `MediaIT#shouldUploadProcessPublishExposeAndThenHideMedia`:
- complete -> `PROCESSING` -> async worker -> `READY`
- worker claims with a UUID lease, checks stored original size, generates 6 variants (WebP + JPEG for thumb/card/cover)
- private variants persisted; original private
- public API only sees READY + published + non-archived + active room media
- `MediaProcessingWorkerTest` covers claim loss, transient retry, archive/lease fencing, exhausted attempts and oversized stored object
- `MediaProcessingRecoveryTest` covers stale PROCESSING re-enqueue; archived rows are excluded by query

Result: PASS (MediaIT 7/7, worker/recovery unit tests).
